# Portfolio

My personal site. I'm Eugen, a design engineer based in Berlin, and this is where
my work lives.

I built it from scratch because none of the templates felt like me. It's just
HTML, CSS, and a bit of JavaScript — no framework, no build step. I wanted
something fast that I fully understand and can change whenever I want.

The hero has some animated glow lines I was messing around with, and the first
project embeds a live 3D ripple surface rendered with Three.js instead of a
screenshot. Everything else is the usual: who I am, a few projects with the
problem/process/outcome behind each one, what I can do, and how to reach me.

It's never really finished. I keep tweaking it.

— Eugen
